    "description": "A collection of two vintage 12-inch vinyl records featuring classic orchestral and musical theater recordings. These albums offer a glimpse into mid-century audio production and are suitable for collectors of vintage vinyl.\nRodgers & Hammerstein's Pipe Dream, Original Cast Recording, RCA Victor LOC-1023.\nAndre Kostelanetz and His Orchestra, You and the Night and the Music, Columbia CL 772.\nBoth records are 33 1/3 RPM long play albums.\nIncludes original cardboard sleeves with track listings and liner notes.\nCondition:\nThese are pre-owned vintage records. The sleeves show signs of age, including edge wear, corner rubbing, and some surface discoloration. Please see photos for details.\nDisclaimer: Please note that all items have been donated. All items are used and untested. All items are not Authenticated. Unless otherwise notated all autographed items have not been authenticated by a third party. We do our best to ensure the quality of all our auctions & describe them accurately; however, we are not experts in any field. Items may contain unseen flaws not noted in the description.\nAll items are sold AS IS.\nPlease read our policies below before placing your bid\nThank you for bidding on an item from Goodwill Serving Southern Los Angeles County. 88 cents from every dollar raised goes to funding our mission to help people in our community with barriers to employment.\nPlease see images for further detail and please ask any questions you may have\nbefore\nmaking a bid.\nWhen purchasing a pick-up only item, you have 10 days to pick up after payment, after which, your item will be donated back to Goodwill with no refund given.\nIf Approved for return, Refunds will not be given on shipping and handling charges.\nNote: Any extra props (i.e., stands, mannequins, shoe horns etc.) are not part of the auction and are for presentation purposes only.\nWe appreciate your support.\nGoodwill SOLAC",
